  "releaseNotes": "- Bug Fix: Corrected Common IAM TLS certificate validation by centralizing thumbprint and trust-store checks for TCP and dynamic-config HTTP connections (LDS-5970).\n          - Technical Improvement: Added sliding-window queue metrics with .NET Metrics export and expanded Sdk.GetQueueStats() for SDK tools query (LDS-5147).\n          - Technical Improvement: Refactored and extended the standalone QA TestApp for manual SDK validation (LDS-5736).\n          - Vulnerability: Updated log4net, System.Security.Cryptography.Xml, BouncyCastle.Cryptography (net48), and related Microsoft.Extensions dependencies.\n          - Technical Improvement: Upgraded LiveData DataModel to 1.0.364 (livedata-core 1.0.364).",
